---
description: Everdell Tracker uses Budgit API on www.budgit.lol
alwaysApply: true
---
Everdell online mode calls the Budgit Django API (separate repo).
Before implementing API clients:
- Read `docs/budgit-api/EVERDELL_PHASE1_API.md`
- Read `docs/budgit-api/EVERDELL_PLAYER_ACCOUNTS.md`
- Read `docs/BUDGIT_EVERDELL_INTEGRATION_PLAN.md` for phase status
Rules:
- Base URL: `https://www.budgit.lol` (not apex `budgit.lol`)
- Auth: Everdell-only — `POST /api/everdell/token/cookie/` then `credentials: 'include'` (uses `everdell_access_token`, not Budgit budget cookies)
- Roster UI: show `display_name` and `display_avatar_url`, not raw `name` when linked
- Game payloads: use player UUIDs from API
- Phase 2 scope: Flutter only — do not change Budgit backend from this repo

